s":5,"text_representativeness":0.9268878102302551,"text_excerpt":"Love the ambience here! The staff is super nice & sweet! My wait to receive my drink was not long at all! I tried the King Cake Latte & it was really good! They have numerous places to sit & it's perfect to meet up with someone. It's quiet enough to have a meeting but also good to meet up with a friend just to catch up!"},{"business_id":"1LL54pSLD2MS1u3OvCzygw","review_id":"Q1lDGsqRftscb_y5KD9xig","date":"2019-06-02T21:13:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9268157482147217,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in on a hot Sunday afternoon for some leisure reading and journaling. Upon entering, this is the nicest PJs I've ever been to. The decor and furniture is a Restoration Hardware vibe, a nice addition to New Orleans East. I received a warm welcome from the cashier and after a quick and pleasant exchange, i received my iced chai with almond milk. Wasn't the best iced chai I've had, but i chopped it up to preference. I would love, if they don't already have them, for them to transition to sip cups or paper straws. I love the variety of seating which includes chairs, tables, sofa, counter seating, as well as outdoor tables and chairs. There's also parking in the front and i think along..."},{"business_id":"1LL54pSLD2MS1u3OvCzygw","review_id":"2pu5OO5KTdp_sT5BDsOWyw","date":"2019-08-12T21:57:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9254276156425476,"text_excerpt":"I love this coffee shop for its homey ambiance, courteous and attentive staff, and exceptionally clean bathrooms. Despite being pretty busy each time I've been, it's not too loud so is a great workspace and perfect small group (2-4 ppl) meeting location. Peach tea lemonade, drip coffee, and coffee cake (warmed on request) are my fav menu items! Great place for the employees of the businesses nearby and a nice retreat from the louder coffee shops closer to the CBD. Also the perfect stop when heading out of New Orleans (going east). I highly recommend and will definitely be back!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1LL54pSLD2MS1u3OvCzygw","photo_id":"HoUvJSb78Px-dCHlmgDcGA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/HoUvJSb78Px-dCHlmgDcGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8664842844009399},{"business_id":"1LL54pSLD2MS1u3OvCzygw","photo_id":"UZ-y6235_jj25U5VioBsbA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/UZ-y6235_jj25U5VioBsbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8497883081436157},{"business_id":"1LL54pSLD2MS1u3OvCzygw","photo_id":"WOi4ZWDruOtfm5wREUh7Vg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/WOi4ZWDruOtfm5wREUh7Vg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8182518482208252},{"business_id":"1LL54pSLD2MS1u3OvCzygw","photo_id":"NXsGPrg_tRNx499pP60XBQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/NXsGPrg_tRNx499pP60XBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8155953288078308},{"business_id":"1LL54pSLD2MS1u3OvCzygw","photo_id":"vQGcJK6q1CpXidSXcjYBwg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/vQGcJK6q1CpXidSXcjYBwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8025591373443604}]},"notebook_case":null}
